最終PR HEAD: `db30ab7c38bcf0610a9f28515c3a831c8d8068a9`。
merge SHA: `3d092d1db64fdd3f0744377df98257038eddd32f`。treeは最終HEADと一致する。

- 最終HEAD [CI](https://github.com/albert-einshutoin/qzt/actions/runs/38066724160) / [security](https://github.com/albert-einshutoin/qzt/actions/runs/38066724442): success。GitGuardianもsuccess。
- 同一merge SHA [main CI](https://github.com/albert-einshutoin/qzt/actions/runs/38066881857) / [main security](https://github.com/albert-einshutoin/qzt/actions/runs/38066882360): success。
